Open CASCADE Technology (OCCT)
------------------------------

GuildModel's solid-modelling kernel is Open CASCADE Technology, used through
the `cadquery-ocp` bindings. OCCT is licensed under LGPL-2.1-only with the
Open CASCADE Exception 1.0; the binding layer is Apache-2.0. LGPL-2.1 section 3
permits relicensing under a later GPL, so LGPL-2.1 + GPL-3.0-or-later is a
standard combination and GuildModel links it directly.

Two obligations follow, and they bind any redistributed build:

1. OCCT must remain a REPLACEABLE SHARED LIBRARY. Frozen bundles must ship it
   as separate .so / .dll / .dylib files (PyInstaller's default behaviour),
   never statically linked or otherwise fused into the executable, so that a
   recipient can substitute their own build of the kernel.

2. The LGPL-2.1 licence text and the Open CASCADE Exception must ship with the
   binary, together with a written offer of the corresponding source. OCCT
   sources are available from https://dev.opencascade.org/ and the exact
   version in use is pinned in pyproject.toml.

